      "response": {
        "text": "Root cause: The geo-cache service failed due to an OOM event, causing all cache keys to be evicted and making the cache unavailable. This forced geo-service to call the upstream maps API directly for every request, quickly exceeding rate limits and resulting in high error rates (429s).\n\nAction taken: Restarted the geo-cache service, which restored cache functionality, reduced upstream API calls, and brought the geo-service error rate back to normal.\n\nAffected service: geo-service.",
